import Mathlib

/-!
# Verbatim copy of `lean_mstar`'s hypothesis `CM4E.Waldschmidt.Thm11Kappa`

Source: `lean_mstar/CM4E/Waldschmidt.lean` (namespace `CM4E.Waldschmidt`), read 2026-10-30.
Everything between `namespace` and `end` below is copied **verbatim** (same bodies, same binders,
same `open`s), only the namespace is changed to `LSG.W88.MStarCopy`. Hence, once `lean_mstar`
depends on `lean_lsg`, `LSG.W88.MStarCopy.Thm11Kappa L d₁` and `CM4E.Waldschmidt.Thm11Kappa L d₁`
